{"3485810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kena: Scars of Kosmora", "steam_appid": 3485810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kena’s next adventure from the award-winning studio, Ember Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kena, now an accomplished Spirit Guide, travels to the mysterious island of Kosmora seeking a cure for her affliction and to reconnect with a friend from her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her search uncovers a forgotten, dangerous form of Spirit Guiding and introduces Kena to Spirit Companions – whose powers she will harness to solve puzzles and defeat enemies using new elemental skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kena: Scars of Kosmora, explore a vibrant island full of buried secrets, wandering spirits, epic bosses, and distinct cultures. Awaken ancient temples bound to Kosmora’s hidden past to cleanse a powerful corruption consuming the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on Kena’s next adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kena, a Spirit Guide, who helps corrupted spirits struggling to pass on. Explore a rich world in this story driven action-adventure game featuring fast-paced combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/857d9a95d0d2240882932384c61d0a00.poster.avif?t=1776377221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/857d9a95d0d2240882932384c61d0a00.webm?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/857d9a95d0d2240882932384c61d0a00.mp4?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Spirit Companions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partner with elemental Spirit Companions that will aid you on your journey. Grow their powers and harness their abilities to solve puzzles, battle enemies, and traverse Kosmora. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/762a9ce2e34d8c793a1b5a9b24b4ddf7.poster.avif?t=1776377221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/762a9ce2e34d8c793a1b5a9b24b4ddf7.webm?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/762a9ce2e34d8c793a1b5a9b24b4ddf7.mp4?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Kosmora’s threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new elemental abilities and powerful Spirit Guide techniques to overcome treacherous and diverse combat encounters leading up to epic bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/92dc5e5698d5a260f55ad9a22168cacb.poster.avif?t=1776377221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/92dc5e5698d5a260f55ad9a22168cacb.webm?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/92dc5e5698d5a260f55ad9a22168cacb.mp4?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a beautiful island full of secrets and danger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the mysterious island of Kosmora. Explore vibrant regions, each with their own distinct communities, and learn about the island’s forgotten past as you uncover secrets buried long ago.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/1fdedd69b67cdb927f2a60fb7ae164f6.poster.avif?t=1776377221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/1fdedd69b67cdb927f2a60fb7ae164f6.webm?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/1fdedd69b67cdb927f2a60fb7ae164f6.mp4?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kena’s next adventure from the award-winning studio, Ember Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kena, now an accomplished Spirit Guide, travels to the mysterious island of Kosmora seeking a cure for her affliction and to reconnect with a friend from her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her search uncovers a forgotten, dangerous form of Spirit Guiding and introduces Kena to Spirit Companions – whose powers she will harness to solve puzzles and defeat enemies using new elemental skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kena: Scars of Kosmora, explore a vibrant island full of buried secrets, wandering spirits, epic bosses, and distinct cultures. Awaken ancient temples bound to Kosmora’s hidden past to cleanse a powerful corruption consuming the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on Kena’s next adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kena, a Spirit Guide, who helps corrupted spirits struggling to pass on. Explore a rich world in this story driven action-adventure game featuring fast-paced combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/857d9a95d0d2240882932384c61d0a00.poster.avif?t=1776377221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/857d9a95d0d2240882932384c61d0a00.webm?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/857d9a95d0d2240882932384c61d0a00.mp4?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Spirit Companions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partner with elemental Spirit Companions that will aid you on your journey. Grow their powers and harness their abilities to solve puzzles, battle enemies, and traverse Kosmora. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/762a9ce2e34d8c793a1b5a9b24b4ddf7.poster.avif?t=1776377221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/762a9ce2e34d8c793a1b5a9b24b4ddf7.webm?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/762a9ce2e34d8c793a1b5a9b24b4ddf7.mp4?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Kosmora’s threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new elemental abilities and powerful Spirit Guide techniques to overcome treacherous and diverse combat encounters leading up to epic bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/92dc5e5698d5a260f55ad9a22168cacb.poster.avif?t=1776377221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/92dc5e5698d5a260f55ad9a22168cacb.webm?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/92dc5e5698d5a260f55ad9a22168cacb.mp4?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a beautiful island full of secrets and danger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the mysterious island of Kosmora. Explore vibrant regions, each with their own distinct communities, and learn about the island’s forgotten past as you uncover secrets buried long ago.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/1fdedd69b67cdb927f2a60fb7ae164f6.poster.avif?t=1776377221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/1fdedd69b67cdb927f2a60fb7ae164f6.webm?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/extras/1fdedd69b67cdb927f2a60fb7ae164f6.mp4?t=1776377221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Kena’s journey to cure her affliction leads to the island of Kosmora, plagued by its own mysterious corruption. To protect Kosmora, she must master the elements with the aid of spirit companions and dynamic combat in this action-packed yet heartfelt adventure.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/cdc09903826e4e34076552de69664202e51c0392/header.jpg?t=1776377221", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/cb80fec31a06a6337f5148e86a331c169a212baf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776377221", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485810/cb80fec31a06a6337f5148e86a331c169a212baf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776377221", "website": "https://www.playstation.com/games/kena-scars-of-kosmora/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li>